cts ▼ \n\n  New Launch Pre Launch Upcoming Under Construction\n Top Builders ▼ \n\n  Adani Realty Sunteck Realty Kalpataru Limited Arkade Developers Vibe Realty Oberoi Realty Kolte-Patil Rustomjee Group Chandak Group Sattva\n Properties ▼ \n\n  Apartments ▼\n\n  2 BHK 3 BHK 4 BHK\n\n  Plots\n Blog\n Contact Us\n\n# Find Residential Projects in Goregaon, Mumbai\n\nExplore a wide range of residential projects in Goregaon Mumbai. From new launch projects in Goregaon East to upcoming apartments in Goregaon West, find rera verified homes with modern amenities, excellent metro connectivity, and great price appreciation. Get floor plans, price lists, and early bird discounts.\n\nResidential projects in Goregaon Mumbai luxury apartments banner [...] The micro-market offers a diverse housing mix including 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and premium 4 BHK flats in Goregaon, with property prices typically ranging from ₹18,000 to ₹35,000 per sq. ft., while total investment values start around ₹75 lakh and extend beyond ₹4 crore in luxury and high-rise developments. Major infrastructure-led transformation, including the 143-acre Motilal Nagar redevelopment by Adani Realty and multiple society redevelopment projects in Goregaon East and West, is significantly boosting the supply of modern gated communities, high-rise residential towers, and premium lifestyle apartments with amenities like clubhouse, swimming pool, landscaped gardens, and smart security systems. With strong rental demand from working professionals, average rental yields of around 2.5% [...] Top residential projects in Goregaon include Oberoi Exquisite, Lodha Azzuro, and Raymond Realty The Address. They offer luxury amenities and good connectivity.\n\nQ2. Are there affordable housing projects in Goregaon East? \n\nYes, affordable housing projects in Goregaon East are available from Mhada and some private builders with 1 BHK units starting near ₹75 lakhs.\n\nQ3. Which are the best gated community projects in Goregaon West? \n\